msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"No! I can't believe I lost! How can you be this strong!? I underestimated "
"you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "You did pretty well, but you're clearly out of practice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"You're right! I'm sorry for not taking this more seriously! I'm never gonna "
"get a girl like this... I need to get back to my training, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"There's nothing wrong with wanting to be strong or have money, but you need "
"more than that if you want a woman. You've got to be a real man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"And you're never going to find a woman if you keep wearing that frown "
"wherever you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "You're right... Thanks for the tips!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "I shouldn't be wasting my time working here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "I've gotta work on myself instead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Fighting him dredged up memories of one of the Komaki techniques I used to "
"know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"You can now use <Color:9>Komaki Parry<Color:Default>. Hold "
"<Action:Battle_Fight_Stance@Combat> to enter a fighting stance, then press "
"<Action:Battle_Drop_Weapon@Combat> when an enemy attacks with a bare fist to"
" activate this technique."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Well, I'd better find the next student."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"I've defeated all of the old man's pupils. I'd better get back to the Komaki"
" Dojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Heh. Looks like I won that one, Kiryu-san! You've got a little more training"
" to do yourself, huh? Come back and face me anytime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "(Damn, I lost... I should try fighting him again sometime.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Oh, hello, Mr. Kiryu. Looking for a rematch?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Heh... You got it. I don't mind gettin' another victory under my belt. Let's"
" do this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "No worries. Come back anytime. I'm always ready to take you on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Hey, you! Why don't you take a load off at our hostess club? Our girls are "
"as cute as they come!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Not right now. I've got business with you, actually. Are you one of Komaki's"
" students?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Wha... By any chance, are you Kazuma Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Yeah, that's me."
msgstr "Sì, sono io."

msgctxt "544"
msgid "So you're the famous Kiryu..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Heh. Master Komaki told me all about you. He wants you to fight his former "
"pupils so you can remember the moves he taught you in the past, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... If a man wants to be popular with women in Kamurocho, what is "
"the one thing he needs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Huh? You asking for my advice or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"You see, Kiryu-san, I've seen a lot of people in my time here, and I've "
"determined that strength isn't the only thing you need to be drowning in "
"women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "You have to be swimming in cash! That's what's really important!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"I realized I'd have a better chance with women if I worked hard and saved up"
" money for a year instead of wasting my time training with Komaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "That's why I'm working here now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Hey, if I beat you, will you give me a little extra cash? Hahaha, just "
"kidding!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Having money can definitely make life easier, but it can't buy you "
"everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Did you really quit training with Komaki to make a bit more money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"I mean, I liked training, and getting stronger, too, but I know it takes "
"more than sheer strength to impress women..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"Besides, I'm already pretty strong! It's time for me to work on something "
"else!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Hmm... Strength isn't everything, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Well, why don't you show me just how strong you really are. Let's do this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Yeah, you're going down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "No, maybe later."
msgstr ""

